 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I can't figure out which coffee beans to order for the office.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "block": "coffee.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm going to read out a few choices, and I'll let you know when I've finished.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instruction_v2_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure.",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One is a dark roast that's bold and smoky, the kind most people expect from office coffee.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.97,
   "block": "coffee.opt2",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Another is a light roast from a small farm, fruity and bright, but some people find it sour.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 6.11,
   "block": "coffee.opt2",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or we could get a medium blend that's smooth and balanced and a bit cheaper by the pound.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 4.02,
   "block": "coffee.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Um, I think I'm done. Yeah. What do you think?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_v2_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Do people mostly drink it with milk and sugar? If so, the dark roast holds up better. If not, the medium blend is a nice middle ground.",
   "est_sec": 8.47,
   "gap_before": 0.88,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "coffee.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hey Kennedy, is the wifi dropping for you too?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.8,
   "block": "nq_work_073",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_work_073",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Kennedy"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I dropped my camera in the sand at the beach. It sounds crunchy when I zoom. Please help.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 2.99,
   "block": "photography.dlg14",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "First, don't zoom or turn it on and off any more. Grinding sand gets in deeper every time the lens moves.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "photography.dlg14"
  },
  {
